## 1. Aim
To implement and compare three popular tokenization techniques used in Natural Language Processing (NLP): Byte Pair Encoding (BPE), WordPiece, and SentencePiece. The comparison is performed using English, Telugu, and Hindi text.

## 2. Tools and Technologies
- Python 3.10+
- Visual Studio Code
- Hugging Face Transformers
- SentencePiece
- Pretrained tokenizer models

## 3. Tokenizers Used

| Tokenization Method | Pretrained Model |
|---|---|
| BPE | GPT-2 (`gpt2`) |
| WordPiece | Multilingual BERT (`bert-base-multilingual-cased`) |
| SentencePiece | XLM-RoBERTa (`xlm-roberta-base`) |

## 4. Languages Tested
- English
- Telugu
- Hindi

## 5. Project Files
- `tokenizer_comparison.py` – Python implementation for loading tokenizers and comparing their outputs.
